6. ELONGATEDNESS: Key for identifying stretched shapes like VAN or BUS.
7. SCALED_VARIANCE_ALONG_MINOR_AXIS: Captures stability or spread along the minor axis, useful in distinguishing wide vehicles (e.g., BUS) from narrow ones (e.g., SAAB).
8. KURTOSIS/ SKEWNESS_ABOUT_AXES: Higher-order moments provide statistical insight into asymmetry (SAAB vs. OPEL).

